// MEV-10-007 — NFT AMMâ€“NFT AMM arbitrage
// Detector family: N_AMM (DETERMINISTIC_IF_FIRM_EXIT)
// Generated by scripts/generate_cartridges_v3.py from the canonical Excel
// (02_CARTRIDGE_MATH_MAP). Universal Cartridge Contract v3.
// RU-5 wave E (G10): real hunting math (fail-honest, RULE 00 / R8).
//
// Detector (economic, per manifest 02_CARTRIDGE_MATH_MAP):
//   Use exact NFT AMM bonding curve quote for acquisition/unwind and compare against firm marketplace bid/ask for same eligible asset/collection, net of royalties/fees.
// Primary operators (evidence only, math-engine): [21, 15, 8]
// Secondary operators (evidence only): [10, 22]
//
//   pool_data.nft — NFT market feed (firm quotes, listings, redemptions;
//   no pipeline binding populates it today, so this cartridge waits
//   fail-honest with nft_floor_feed_unavailable). Shape when it lands:
//   #{ collection, token_id, asset_class,
//      denom_token (payment token address, e.g. WETH),
//      ask_venue, ask_px (denom per NFT, firm listing), buy_fee_bps,
//      bid_venue, bid_px (denom, firm bid), bid_depth (NFTs), sell_fee_bps,
//      royalty_bps, bid_venue_zr: #{ venue, bid_px, sell_fee_bps } (016),
//      floor_px_a / floor_px_b (venue floors — SIGNAL only, never profit),
//      trait_premium (003), basket: [#{collection, ask_px, bid_px}, ...] (004),
//      mint_px, mint_open (008),
//      amm: #{ pool, nft_side, fee_bps }, amm_b: #{ pool, nft_side, fee_bps } (006/007),
//      fraction_supply, fraction_bid_px (010), fraction_ask_px (011),
//      redeem_value (018), bundle: [#{bid_px}, ...] (017),
//      loan: #{ debt_px, health_factor } (012),
//      rental: #{ rate_daily, period_days } (013),
//      src_chain, dst_chain, bridge_fee_bps, risk_discount_bps (015),
//      ts (unix sec) }
//   Prices are in denom_token human units unless suffixed _usd.
//
// Zero-Mocks / Fail-Honest: every number below is computed from the documented
// payload + the runner host bindings (get_reserves / get_token_meta /
// get_token_price_usd / get_block_number / get_timestamp / get_math_evidence).
// Missing feed/reserves/decimals/prices => is_opportunity:false + the exact
// machine-readable reason, never a fabricated number (RULE 00 / R8).
//
// NOTE: the runner invokes evaluate_opportunity with an EMPTY scope, so Rhai
// global `const`s are NOT visible inside functions. All config is inlined as
// literals in each function below. (Coarse gas precheck GAS_HINT_USD=5.0; the
// authoritative net gate is downstream.)

